          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Stroke Control\n\nMake the stroke widget a small graph of its own: real Properties, a preview that keeps itself current, and a Bridge that exposes its events, so the Edge Class template is edited through composed controls.\n\nThis builds on the Edge Class template and on the Bridge Editor idea, `github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/bridge-editor/root.node`."
        },
