        "title": "How does the consumer listen to any stroke?",
        "question": "When strokes are separate graphs reached through Bridges, how does the Edge Class template react to a change in any of them without a Handler per stroke?",
        "status": "open",
        "answer": "Class-scoped listening has to cross Bridges: the export side exposes a class's events and an import Handler listens to the class. Bridges expose events node by node today, so this is a real gap and the second next step.",
